\* private/fed/server/fed_server.py:1013-1026; private/fed/client/communicator.py:729-754  [X1/X3: CP listing from the latest heartbeat; repeated reply = fresh seq]
FederatedServerHeartbeatCleanup(s) ==
    LET t == T0 IN
    /\ HBView(s) = 2
    /\ ~jobs[t[1]].serverRegistered
    /\ ~jobs[t[1]].outcomeKey \/ jobs[t[1]].serverFailed
    /\ HBStopFree(s)
    /\ net' = Send(net, HBStopMsg(s))
    /\ UNCHANGED <<jobSP_f, pJobSP>>

